<h3><u>Pyaasi hai sakina</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haaye sakina, sakina..(2)<br />
Ae baade sabaa jaake ye ammu ko batana,..(2)<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>1. Is chhote se sinn me ye sitam maine uthaye<br />
Allah kisi ko na yateem aisa banaye<br />
khud apne lahu mein koi bachi na nahaye<br />
mai tumko bulati rahi tum bhi to na aaye<br />
mai ban gayi baad asr laeeno ka nishaana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>2. Paani ki talab mujhko khilati rahi thokar<br />
kehta tha laee&#39;n dunga mai faujo&#39;n ko pilakar<br />
jab shimr e laee&#39;n kar chuka sairaab ye lashkar<br />
dikhlake mujhe faik diya paani zamee&#39;n par<br />
tab samjhi mai kya hota hai ummeed dilana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>3. Ek jaam hua shaam e ghareeba mein mayassar<br />
wo kooza mai rakh aayi thi asghar ki lahad par<br />
tha mujhse bhi chhota mera bhaiyya mera dilbar<br />
sharminda mai hojati chacha pyaas bujha kar<br />
ab apne hi haatho&#39;n se meri pyaas bujhana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>4. Ek rassi mein hum sabke gale baandh ke aada<br />
karte hue tash&#39;heer chale jaanibe koofa<br />
aur uspe musibat ye thi qad chota tha mera<br />
uth ti thi jo phuphiya&#39;n to gala khichta tha mera<br />
gardan ka mere zakhm chacha dekhne aana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>5. Jis roz se asghar ko mila baba ka seena<br />
us roz se ammu nahi so paayi sakina<br />
is haal mein jaungi mai kis tarha madina<br />
aa jaye mujhe maut hai kis kaam ka jeena<br />
jaagi hu bohot aake chacha mujhko sulana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>6. Ghar laut ke jaate hai har ek shaam parinde<br />
qismat mein likhe hai meri zindaa&#39;n ke andhere<br />
kab tak mai jiyungi yuhi ashko&#39;n ke sahare<br />
lagta hai ke marjaungi ab door watan se<br />
hoga na mayassar mujhe ghar laut ke jaana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina</p>

<p>7. Anwar ye sadaa parchame abbas se aayi<br />
mai bhool nahi sakta sakina meri bachhi<br />
kaate gaye baazu mere majboor tha bibi<br />
mashkeeza alam mein hai laga dekhle ab bhi<br />
parcham ka mere kaam hai duniya ko batana<br />
pyaasi hai sakina<br />
Ae baade sabaa jaake ye ammu ko batana<br />
Pyaasi hai sakina..(3)</p>
</p>
